values ('d6f1b8a3-2c47-4e09-9b15-8a0e4c7d3f62', 'first-aid-cpr-emergency-response', 'First Aid / CPR / Emergency Response', 'This course prepares kinesiology students to recognize emergencies, protect the scene, activate emergency services, perform primary and secondary assessment, provide adult, child, and infant CPR, use an AED, manage choking, control bleeding, care for shock, respond to fractures, sprains, head/neck/spine injuries, heat and cold emergencies, and participate in emergency action plans. The course emphasizes hands-on practice, sport and exercise settings, team communication, documentation, special populations, certification readiness, and reflective improvement.');

