fe, confident AED use.", "children": [{"id": "132e2bfb-b6e1-4564-b0ba-74190ee3872b", "type": "concept", "title": "Power on and pad placement"}, {"id": "40b13939-ef93-4b2c-b5bd-4c7bb9ee66e5", "type": "concept", "title": "Clear for analysis"}, {"id": "d1facdea-8f0a-401c-8abd-ba4b19f6a93b", "type": "concept", "title": "Clear for shock"}, {"id": "ed90f3c1-97bd-45fb-8721-b3fd81fc9763", "type": "concept", "title": "Resume CPR immediately"}]}, {"id": "11b49b37-e360-41e7-9400-bb60f41c8029", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Team response", "description": "Cardiac arrest response improves when roles are clear.", "children": [{"id": "eaacc288-d474-4c0a-844f-212451cd1068", "type": "concept", "title": "Compressor"}, {"id": "cda7d4ca-72d1-4207-988c-f97f35d48a17", "type": "concept", "title": "AED operator"}, {"id": "d1073929-fb6d-45a3-81fe-2a92911aecac", "type": "concept", "title": "EMS caller"}, {"id": "33c91d3d-e24f-4827-ba38-ffd74716f052", "type": "concept", "title": "Crowd and scene manager"}]}]}, {"id": "5d63981a-e7af-48e3-8e3a-82e9ec383651", "type": "topic", "title": "Airway Obstruction, Choking, and Rescue Breathing Basics", "description": "Prepare students to manage airway obstruction and breathing emergencies in adults, children, and infants.", "children": [{"id": "747e2977-a815-4569-aab7-ee750b3ff2a4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Choking recognition", "description": "Students learn to distinguish mild from severe obstruction.", "children": [{"id": "1e85ea7d-2556-46fd-99ce-52ffd9de68b4", "type": "concept", "title": "Effective coughing"}, {"id": "41cf4e53-9b20-4b5f-9c90-935518960566", "type": "concept", "title": "Universal choking sign"}, {"id": "fa0a1d32-6b01-4ae4-be7c-bfd301b23cdd", "type": "concept", "title": "Unable to speak or breathe"}, {"id": "f68f7c3d-744d-485f-bf67-695057a52499", "type": "concept", "title": "Cyanosis and collapse"}]}, {"id": "b5eb9b18-5482-42a3-bf84-bef2d0feb246", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Choking care", "description": "Students practice age-appropriate relief of airway obstruction.", "children": [{"id": "8bc45b6c-4244-44bf-b5b6-e70c1bed00a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Abdominal thrusts"}, {"id": "94bd8ba7-479d-44f0-8b1e-e1873a7bb2bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Chest thrusts when indicated"}, {"id": "155ec84c-7ca8-455d-8cea-4e4598b136f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Infant back blows and chest thrusts"}, {"id": "90ddb249-f68f-4291-9a02-deed1e4f3e63", "type": "concept", "title": "Transition to CPR if unconscious"}]}, {"id": "06e0175e-8d51-4084-99a8-151d25d3d2a1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Breathing support basics", "description": "Students learn foundational ventilation concepts used in CPR and emergency care.", "children": [{"id": "aade05c2-0d85-4530-865c-4dd9b2c6451c", "type": "concept", "title": "Open airway"}, {"id": "ad336db0-5ada-4a8d-9717-3a5ceb98e1fd", "type": "concept", "title": "Recovery position when appropriate"}, {"id": "7373fd7a-49f4-4c14-8d2b-4ec482221d87", "type": "concept", "title": "Rescue breaths"}, {"id": "d8aa8fdd-c6b7-4871-9645-ef5e6638d731", "type": "concept", "title": "Barrier devices"}]}]}, {"id": "2e4acfdf-109e-498a-8a06-5104422665af", "type": "topic", "title": "Bleeding Control, Wound Care, and Stop the Bleed Skills", "description": "Teach immediate hemorrhage control and practical care for common wounds in sport, fitness, and community settings.", "children": [{"id": "97cd7199-c72a-4e29-9138-cb43c89268e8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Severe bleeding control", "description": "Students learn immediate actions for life-threatening hemorrhage.", "children": [{"id": "79207e48-000a-41e2-943a-c747c79b658a", "type": "concept", "title": "Direct pressure"}, {"id": "18934f8b-9f9a-402a-850b-f1fc8de2856b", "type": "concept", "title": "Wound packing"}, {"id": "79a03f90-cb9e-4366-b99d-98ab79b4b373", "type": "concept", "title": "Tourniquet placement"}, {"id": "f49f4649-0fc7-4462-ac84-86433bcfd331", "type": "concept", "title": "Reassessment and EMS handoff"}]}, {"id": "6e5283c6-f440