tice safe, confident AED use.", "children": [{"id": "132e2bfb-b6e1-4564-b0ba-74190ee3872b", "type": "concept", "title": "Power on and pad placement"}, {"id": "40b13939-ef93-4b2c-b5bd-4c7bb9ee66e5", "type": "concept", "title": "Clear for analysis"}, {"id": "d1facdea-8f0a-401c-8abd-ba4b19f6a93b", "type": "concept", "title": "Clear for shock"}, {"id": "ed90f3c1-97bd-45fb-8721-b3fd81fc9763", "type": "concept", "title": "Resume CPR immediately"}]}, {"id": "11b49b37-e360-41e7-9400-bb60f41c8029", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Team response", "description": "Cardiac arrest response improves when roles are clear.", "children": [{"id": "eaacc288-d474-4c0a-844f-212451cd1068", "type": "concept", "title": "Compressor"}, {"id": "cda7d4ca-72d1-4207-988c-f97f35d48a17", "type": "concept", "title": "AED operator"}, {"id": "d1073929-fb6d-45a3-81fe-2a92911aecac", "type": "concept", "title": "EMS caller"}, {"id": "33c91d3d-e24f-4827-ba38-ffd74716f052", "type": "concept", "title": "Crowd and scene manager"}]}]}, {"id": "5d63981a-e7af-48e3-8e3a-82e9ec383651", "type": "topic", "title": "Airway Obstruction, Choking, and Rescue Breathing Basics", "description": "Prepare students to manage airway obstruction and breathing emergencies in adults, children, and infants.", "children": [{"id": "747e2977-a815-4569-aab7-ee750b3ff2a4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Choking recognition", "description": "Students learn to distinguish mild from severe obstruction.", "children": [{"id": "1e85ea7d-2556-46fd-99ce-52ffd9de68b4", "type": "concept", "title": "Effective coughing"}, {"id": "41cf4e53-9b20-4b5f-9c90-935518960566", "type": "concept", "title": "Universal choking sign"}, {"id": "fa0a1d32-6b01-4ae4-be7c-bfd301b23cdd", "type": "concept", "title": "Unable to speak or breathe"}, {"id": "f68f7c3d-744d-485f-bf67-695057a52499", "type": "concept", "title": "Cyanosis and collapse"}]}, {"id": "b5eb9b18-5482-42a3-bf84-bef2d0feb246", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Choking care", "description": "Students practice