c6-f440-4dbe-a303-5d5861609daf", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Common wound care", "description": "Students learn practical first aid for everyday sport and community injuries.", "children": [{"id": "c8655e37-82d5-44b4-838d-6b38523ee593", "type": "concept", "title": "Abrasions"}, {"id": "41ea7e98-e0a0-47c1-8c4b-95cfd75bfd97", "type": "concept", "title": "Lacerations"}, {"id": "cca5b339-9f12-42e7-b947-7ebfda55e990", "type": "concept", "title": "Punctures"}, {"id": "b6de88be-9173-4300-9f42-f3736308f24e", "type": "concept", "title": "Burns and blisters"}]}, {"id": "032fee4f-357f-4f3e-aadd-493705ead246", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Infection and exposure awareness", "description": "Students learn to protect the patient and responder after bleeding incidents.", "children": [{"id": "29dc9916-c348-46ad-a1a1-1855a57333b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Glove use"}, {"id": "969a954b-710c-48c3-85d6-d795d9ea9a68", "type": "concept", "title": "Cleaning and covering wounds"}, {"id": "b9461006-9a62-44d2-973b-49855dcfdc87", "type": "concept", "title": "Tetanus referral awareness"}, {"id": "fd02e517-090f-4ad0-9bf8-acd5854f3163", "type": "concept", "title": "Biohazard disposal"}]}]}, {"id": "8f2e235e-c46f-49d3-acee-28618dac3daa", "type": "topic", "title": "Shock, Medical Emergencies, and Recognition of Deterioration", "description": "Train students to recognize systemic emergencies early and provide supportive care while help arrives.", "children": [{"id": "d34c559d-c946-4abd-abfc-e156005addf9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Shock recognition", "description": "Students learn that shock is a life-threatening circulation problem, not just feeling upset.", "children": [{"id": "070dd21f-84d5-4511-b903-b97a6ad74e5a", "type": "concept", "title": "Pale/cool/clammy skin"}, {"id": "d8760a03-3286-4554-a73b-2c700d39dce8", "type": "concept", "title": "Rapid pulse"}, {"id": "debbfaee-ac43-4178-8b8d-bf8bfdce9879", "type": "concept", "title": "Weakness or confusion"}, {"id": "02a7668d-0bae-4c27-9